{
 "id": "long04",
 "show": "FULL CLEAR",
 "label": "GUIDE",
 "title": "20 things GTA 6 doesn't tell you",
 "episode": "Beginner guide \u00b7 Nov 2026",
 "cast": {
  "Nia": {}
 },
 "lines": [
  [
   "Nia",
   "Nia here."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "GTA Six doesn't explain half of what matters."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "So here are twenty things the game doesn't tell you, with no story spoilers."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "One: don't rush to Vice City."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Key Lento is your training ground."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Learn the new systems there first."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Two: lots of features unlock through the story, like banking and registering cars."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "If something is missing, play a couple more missions."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Three: keep more than one manual save."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Some choices stick, so keep a clean save and a chaos save."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Four: when you die or get arrested, you lose the cash you're carrying."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Never go looking for trouble with your savings in your pocket."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Five: before you have a bank, Jason's bedroom has loose floorboards."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Stash your cash there."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Six: once banking unlocks, you still have to visit an A T M to deposit."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "The bank app can guide you to the nearest one."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Seven: loot bags can be lost too."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "After a robbery, sell or store the goods first."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Eight: weapons you buy aren't gone for good."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "If you lose them, the weapons locker at a gun shop has them."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Nine: after a shootout, loot the bodies."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Cash and ammo early on make a real difference."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Ten: Jason and Lucia can get stronger."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Health, stamina and focus all improve with training."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Eleven: you don't need a gym to start."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Jason has workout gear at home."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Train a few mornings in a row and you'll feel it."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Twelve: your phone has a fitness tracker."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Check it before you waste an afternoon lifting for nothing."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Thirteen: food and drinks give short boosts."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Grab something at home before a hard mission."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Fourteen: press both sticks for focus mode."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Red shows enemies, yellow shows things you can use, and green shows cash."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Fifteen: focus also shows doors."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "White means you can open it."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Red means it's alarmed."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Sixteen: hit markers tell a story."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "White is a hit, yellow means you knocked them out, red means lethal."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Seventeen: you have a criminal profile, a bit like honor in Red Dead."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "And the worst level can't be undone, so be careful on your main save."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Eighteen: the cops don't show on your minimap any more."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "They work from witnesses and descriptions, so a hat, glasses or a new outfit really matters."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Save spare outfits to your car from the safehouse, and change in a chase."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Nineteen: police also remember your car."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Respray it or switch cars, and don't use your favourite ride for every crime."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Twenty: some of the best tricks are hidden in plain sight."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Hold the D-pad down in a car for the cinematic camera, and you can let the game drive you to your waypoint."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "And if your car flips, hold Square to push it back over yourself."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Bonus: stolen cars only stay yours once you can register them, so check the price before you pay."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "That's twenty."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Every spot we talk about is pinned on our free map at fullclear map dot com."
  ],
  [
   "Nia",
   "Nia, out."
  ]
 ],
